#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0287B expect=violation domain=ADAE
#note "KEY=AERELN (2nd arg), DEPENDENT=AEREL (1st arg): key 1 carries {RELATED,UNLIKELY} -> rows 1,2 fire; key 2 is single-valued. Record granularity -> 2 violations."
